
MPI3 wrapper

Created with (run from top level qmcpack directory):
git subtree add --squash -P external_codes/mpi_wrapper/mpi3 https://gitlab.com/correaa/boost-mpi3.git master

To update the subtree to the 0.91.0 tag, run from the top-level QMCPACK source directory:
git subtree pull --squash -P external_codes/mpi_wrapper/mpi3 https://gitlab.com/correaa/boost-mpi3.git 0.91.0
